# __NAME__ — Instructions for Claude

This repo is a domain of HQ (`__HQ_REPO__`). Work here follows HQ's Work Item lifecycle:
`orchestration/lifecycle.md` in `__HQ_REPO__` (checked out at `.hq/orchestration/lifecycle.md`
during a run).

## Rules
- **The Issue is the memory.** Every decision, result and piece of evidence goes on the
  Work Item Issue, not in chat.
- **Never store passwords, keys, or secrets anywhere in git.**

## Where things go
- `.claude/agents/` — agents specific to this domain.
- `.claude/skills/` — skills specific to this domain.
- `workflows/` — workflows specific to this domain.

A file in any of these three folders wins over an HQ one of the same name.
